# An unblocked Necrite targets a creature the defending player controls, then may sacrifice itself to destroy it (CR 509.1h, 701.8a, 701.21a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Necrite
Ornithopter
Swamp x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Necrite.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Attackers]
Bot1.Attack(Necrite > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Necrite.Colors = Black
Bot2.Graveyard.Ornithopter.Colors =
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Life = 20
